WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.733
Water was filling the boat.

2
00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:11.790
It reached Tom's knees.

3
00:00:11.791 --> 00:00:14.740
The prince climbed onto a barrel.

4
00:00:14.741 --> 00:00:19.712
"Help!" he yelled. "I'll drown!"

5
00:00:19.713 --> 00:00:27.690
Tom waved his wand. "Water, flow away!"

6
00:00:27.691 --> 00:00:30.729
The water flowed away from Tom.

7
00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:33.621
But it flowed toward the barrel.

8
00:00:33.622 --> 00:00:36.506
Now the water reached the prince's knees!

9
00:00:36.507 --> 00:00:38.780
"Oops!" Tom said.

10
00:00:38.781 --> 00:00:43.921
"Help!" the prince called. "Save me!"

11
00:00:43.922 --> 00:00:46.353
Cat looked at the net.

12
00:00:46.354 --> 00:00:49.676
"The fish are too heavy," she said.

13
00:00:49.677 --> 00:00:52.508
"You must let them out of the net."

14
00:00:52.509 --> 00:00:57.533
Tom tried to open the net.

15
00:00:57.534 --> 00:01:00.630
"There is a big knot!" he said.

16
00:01:00.631 --> 00:01:06.476
The boat was sinking fast.

17
00:01:06.477 --> 00:01:08.958
Cat leaped onto the net.

18
00:01:08.959 --> 00:01:16.858
Tom lifted his wand. "Rise, boat!"

19
00:01:16.859 --> 00:01:19.075
Cat bit a big hole.

20
00:01:19.076 --> 00:01:21.830
Then she ripped the net open.

21
00:01:21.831 --> 00:01:29.045
The fish quickly swam out.

22
00:01:29.046 --> 00:01:34.434
The boat began to rise!

23
00:01:34.435 --> 00:01:38.083
"You saved me, Tom!" the prince cried.

24
00:01:38.084 --> 00:01:48.638
"I want to go home and finish my lessons."

25
00:01:48.639 --> 00:01:51.759
The king and queen sat on their thrones.

26
00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:55.460
Prince Eric was working hard.

27
00:01:55.461 --> 00:01:58.201
The queen smiled happily.

28
00:01:58.202 --> 00:02:01.400
"Thank you, Wizard," she said.

29
00:02:01.401 --> 00:02:03.827
"I don't know what you did.

30
00:02:03.828 --> 00:02:08.575
But now Prince Eric is doing all his lessons!"

31
00:02:08.576 --> 00:02:11.203
"Yes, Tom," the king said.

32
00:02:11.204 --> 00:02:15.784
"Eric is working hard—like me!"

33
00:02:15.785 --> 00:02:20.673
Tom bowed.

34
00:02:20.674 --> 00:02:33.797
"The prince will be a fine king someday," he said.

